WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.550
Night city. Rain slants across buildings as warm headlights travel through reflections on a wet road.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:15.500
Sunrise coast. The camera observes drifting clouds and moving ripples on sunlit blue-green water.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:23.500
Liquid study. Interfering ripples and highlights move across a cool, close-up water surface.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.250
Golden landscape. Layered desert ridges move with parallax while fine sand passes through the frame.
